This contains minor spoilers on the elemental plane of air.



























Ok, so there I was with my first character on the elemental plane of air.
It was a level 30 tourist with EVERYTHING - speed boots, SOR, 3 AOLS,
all the intrinsics, conflict, extremely lucky, +7 vorpy, +6 Mojo and so
on. Bound to be a winner, I thought. So I read this cursed scroll of gold
detection, find the portal and head for it. However, literally dozens and
dozens of monster come in my way, air elementals carry me away, and I just
get nowhere.

So, after a couple of hundred turns I'm surrounded by 20+ monsters, several
of which have wands of create monster, and the monsters just won't give me
a break. Sure, they only give me aprox 10 hp damage per turn, but I just
couldn't do anything about it and 2000 turns later all my AOLS were gone
and I died. So, my question is: what the hell to do? I can't genocide
archons, I can't teleport, I can't run away as there was always eight
monsters around me, I can't kill the archons with a wand of death, nor
can I polymorph them. Sigh...

After losing that character I'm not sure I will play again.
